message: "If you use SfSkills in your work, please cite it using the metadata below."
type: software
title: "SfSkills: Salesforce AI Skill Library"
abstract: >-
  A source-available library of Salesforce skill packages, run-time agents and an
  MCP server that give AI coding assistants Salesforce reference material to read
  before answering: platform failure modes and known-wrong LLM output. A claims
  audit against official Salesforce documentation is in progress; most packages
  have not been audited.
